    {
      "block_id": "p-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- One item per call (no looping) - State transitions: running→completed/failed/blocked (event-sourced via queue.mark_*) - Minimal `RuntimeContext` with `coordination_enabled=False` - `FleetQueueRunnerResult` carries only metadata fields, no raw content - Schema uses `oneOf: [{\"type\": \"string\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}]` for nullable fields",
